  "proved_scope": [
    "Actual atomwise execution and literal placement recovery, including fusion",
    "Final occupied-site injectivity implies a fusion-free actual word",
    "Selected-event trace concatenation and right congruence",
    "Registered same-placement future-event soundness",
    "All-parameter dp-block and pre-final gap-probe site fibers",
    "Semantic future-registration criterion on actual singleton-seed generated unregistered states",
    "Source order derives separate singleton fibers, the empty open gap, and bounds 1<=g<=n-2",
    "Every generated semantically registerable state has a gap probe whose prefix is fusion-free and whose last letter first registers the ordered pair",
    "The actual probe suffix length bound 3*n-6 from the current generated source",
    "Every gap parameter 1<=h<=g has a literal descending E-word reaching x^(h), fusion-free at every intermediate predecessor",
    "Every x^(h) is generated and semantically registerable and has the same trace and full terminal execution under the fixed V_x",
    "Lemma 5.3: equality of complete V_x traces and literal terminal placements is equivalent to a unique actual hole-move parameter",
    "The identity comparison is exactly h=g; distinct coalescing comparisons have strictly smaller gap",
    "Exact pd and sweep site maps, including singleton port-zero fibers before later defects without a no-prior-event premise",
    "Aligned sweep recovery from ordered selected records, including null-output carrier movement into an empty port",
    "Actual generated registered states have colocated selected source atoms and an actual carrier packet",
    "Outside-anchored phase recovery with no matching-anchor assumption on the comparison state",
    "Registered placement separation by one common actual W_q of length at most 3*n-4",
    "Two distinct generated registerable states have a common trace-distinguishing suffix of length at most 6*n-10",
    "The structural silent region is exactly the all-future-null region on generated states, with an equivalent current-source-fiber criterion",
    "Actual registered nonterminal states and registerable states have nonnull sweep and gap probes, respectively",
    "Each pair of different observation regions is separated, preserving distinct registration and absorption tags",
    "Equation (6.1): future equivalence is exactly the three structural normal-form alternatives on all generated states for n>=3",
    "The structural normal-form relation is a right congruence on the generated domain",
    "Every inequivalent generated pair has a common actual distinguishing suffix of length at most 6*n-10",
    "Agreement on all traces up to length 6*n-10 is equivalent to all-word future equivalence",
    "The all-word future-equivalence quotient of actual generated states is equivalent to Unit plus actual registerable placements plus actual registered nonterminal placements",
    "A concrete complete seed sweep realizes the silent key and proves that the single silent class is nonempty",
    "Actual raw word continuations descend to the quotient and preserve chronological concatenation",
    "The actual future quotient is finite via its normal-form equivalence, without a history cutoff or an assumed finite raw execution space",
    "Actual generated registerable states are in bijection with their literal placements",
    "The finite actual quotient has cardinality 1+R_n+A_n, with R_n counting actual registerable states and A_n counting literal registered nonterminal placements",
    "Pure finite registerable parameters are equivalent to actual singleton-seed-generated semantically registerable placements; no reachability field occurs in the parameter type",
    "Every registerable parameter is realized by actual outside-assembly words followed by fusion-free placement control; source-key normal form and finite cuts recover the inverse uniquely",
    "Pure carrier-choice and fixed-fibre parameters are equivalent to actual generated registered nonterminal placements; the forward construction reuses pinned actual clean-code/fibre witnesses and the inverse recovers the literal carrier and unique rank parameters",
    "Vandermonde evaluates actual registerable states and placements as R_n=n*choose(2*n-4,n-3) for every n>=3",
    "Weighted hockey-stick identities evaluate actual registered nonterminal placements as A_n=n*sum_{k=1}^{n-2}(n-1-k)*choose(n+k-2,k)=2*(2*n-3)*choose(2*n-4,n-2)-n*(n-1)",
    "The actual all-word future-equivalence quotient has the closed binomial count 1+n*choose(2*n-4,n-3)+2*(2*n-3)*choose(2*n-4,n-2)-n*(n-1), with an additive theorem justifying natural-number subtraction"
  ],
